<view class="page">
  <view class="page-header">
    <view>
      <view class="eyebrow">MINIMAL PROFILE</view>
      <view class="page-title">设置</view>
      <view class="page-subtitle">只保存帮助判断相关性的非敏感方向。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-card card">
    <view class="settings-title">我关心什么</view>
    <view class="settings-copy">选择 1–3 项。AI 可以明确告诉你“目前无关”。</view>
    <view class="topics">
      <view
        wx:for="{{topics}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="topic {{item.selected ? 'topic-selected' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="toggleTopic"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
    <button class="primary-button save-button" bindtap="savePreferences" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存关注方向</button>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-card card">
    <view class="settings-title">本月 AI 用量</view>
    <view class="usage-money">¥ {{usage.costLabel}} <text>/ {{monthlyLimit}}</text></view>
    <view class="settings-copy">输入 {{usage.inputTokens || 0}} Token · 输出 {{usage.outputTokens || 0}} Token。达到 10 元后停止新增处理。</view>
    <view class="settings-copy usage-note">这里只统计模型 Token 预估成本，不包含 CloudBase 套餐和函数流量费用。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-card card">
    <view class="settings-title">30 天验证</view>
    <view class="stats-grid">
      <view class="stat"><text>{{stats.addedCount || 0}}</text><label>已添加</label></view>
      <view class="stat"><text>{{stats.processedCount || 0}}</text><label>已处理</label></view>
      <view class="stat"><text>{{stats.processedWithin7DaysCount || 0}}</text><label>7天内处理</label></view>
      <view class="stat"><text>{{stats.activeDays || 0}}</text><label>活跃天数</label></view>
    </view>
    <view class="settings-copy validation-copy">第 30 天还需要人工判断：是否至少有 5 张卡仍然有用。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-card danger-zone card">
    <view class="settings-title">数据控制</view>
    <view class="settings-copy">不保存昵称、手机号、位置、实名信息或网页全文。你可以随时清空自己的全部数据。</view>
    <button class="danger-button purge-button" bindtap="purgeMyData">清空我的全部数据</button>
  </view>
</view>
